<figure class="chapter-visual field-map">
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创示意图：内外源、E/D 场与纵横响应</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original diagram: internal/external sources, E/D fields, and longitudinal/transverse response</span>
  </figcaption>

  <svg viewBox="0 0 940 420" role="img" aria-labelledby="field-map-title field-map-desc">
    <title id="field-map-title">Source and field hierarchy in dielectric response</title>
    <desc id="field-map-desc">
      External charge and current determine the displacement field D in Martin's Gaussian-unit convention. Internal charge and current define polarization and magnetization, which convert D to the total material field E. Longitudinal response is parallel to wave vector q and can be described by scalar potentials. Transverse response is perpendicular to q and requires current and vector-potential response.
    </desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="field-arrow" markerWidth="9" markerHeight="9" refX="8" refY="4.5" orient="auto">
        <path d="M0,0 L9,4.5 L0,9 z" class="field-map__arrowhead" />
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <g transform="translate(35 40)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="210" height="92" rx="12" class="field-map__box field-map__box--external" />
      <text x="105" y="28" text-anchor="middle">external sources</text>
      <text x="105" y="53" text-anchor="middle">Q nₑₓₜ, jₑₓₜ</text>
      <text x="105" y="78" text-anchor="middle">controlled by boundaries</text>
    </g>

    <line x1="255" y1="86" x2="345" y2="86" marker-end="url(#field-arrow)" class="field-map__arrow" />

    <g transform="translate(355 40)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="210" height="92" rx="12" class="field-map__box field-map__box--external" />
      <text x="105" y="28" text-anchor="middle">displacement field D</text>
      <text x="105" y="53" text-anchor="middle">∇·D = 4πQ nₑₓₜ</text>
      <text x="105" y="78" text-anchor="middle">external-source field</text>
    </g>

    <line x1="575" y1="86" x2="665" y2="86" marker-end="url(#field-arrow)" class="field-map__arrow" />

    <g transform="translate(675 40)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="230" height="92" rx="12" class="field-map__box field-map__box--total" />
      <text x="115" y="28" text-anchor="middle">total field E</text>
      <text x="115" y="53" text-anchor="middle">D = E + 4πP</text>
      <text x="115" y="78" text-anchor="middle">field acting inside matter</text>
    </g>

    <g transform="translate(355 172)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="210" height="104" rx="12" class="field-map__box field-map__box--internal" />
      <text x="105" y="28" text-anchor="middle">internal sources</text>
      <text x="105" y="53" text-anchor="middle">Q nᵢₙₜ, jᵢₙₜ</text>
      <text x="105" y="78" text-anchor="middle">∇·P = −Q nᵢₙₜ</text>
      <text x="105" y="98" text-anchor="middle">∂tP = jᵢₙₜ + ∇×M</text>
    </g>
    <path d="M 565 224 C 650 224, 650 132, 720 116" marker-end="url(#field-arrow)" class="field-map__arrow" />

    <g transform="translate(40 315)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="390" height="78" rx="12" class="field-map__box" />
      <text x="195" y="27" text-anchor="middle">longitudinal: E∥q</text>
      <text x="195" y="52" text-anchor="middle">E = −∇V; density and scalar-potential response</text>
    </g>

    <g transform="translate(510 315)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="390" height="78" rx="12" class="field-map__box" />
      <text x="195" y="27" text-anchor="middle">transverse: E⊥q</text>
      <text x="195" y="52" text-anchor="middle">B = ∇×A; current and vector-potential response</text>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <div class="field-map__fallback">
    <dl>
      <div><dt>外部源 | External sources</dt><dd>边界、电极或探针规定的 charge/current；在 Martin 的 Gaussian convention 中决定 D。</dd></div>
      <div><dt>内部源 | Internal sources</dt><dd>物质诱导的 charge/current；通过 P 和 M 改变总场 E。</dd></div>
      <div><dt>总场 E | Total field E</dt><dd>进入电导和介电响应关系的物质内部总电场。</dd></div>
      <div><dt>位移场 D | Displacement field D</dt><dd>由外部源决定；不是另一种“更强电场”。</dd></div>
      <div><dt>纵向 | Longitudinal</dt><dd>平行于 q，可由 scalar potential 和 density response 描述。</dd></div>
      <div><dt>横向 | Transverse</dt><dd>垂直于 q，需要 current/vector-potential response。</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <dl lang="en">
      <div><dt>External sources</dt><dd>Charge/current imposed by boundaries, electrodes, or probes; they determine D in Martin's Gaussian convention.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Internal sources</dt><dd>Induced charge/current in matter; they modify E through P and M.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Total field E</dt><dd>The total material field entering conductivity and dielectric constitutive relations.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Displacement field D</dt><dd>The field tied to external sources; it is not a second, stronger electric field.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Longitudinal</dt><dd>Parallel to q and described by scalar-potential/density response.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Transverse</dt><dd>Perpendicular to q and described by current/vector-potential response.</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>学习目的：</strong>固定 source 与 response 的对象，避免把 E、D、ε、ε⁻¹、纵向和横向响应互换。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Learning purpose:</strong> fix the source and response objects so that E, D, ε, ε⁻¹, longitudinal response, and transverse response are not interchanged.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong>图和语义列表都必须区分 external/internal sources、E/D 以及 longitudinal/transverse channels。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> both the diagram and semantic list distinguish external/internal sources, E/D, and longitudinal/transverse channels.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>这是 Gaussian-unit 线性响应结构图。拓扑介质、magnetoelectric coupling、非线性和空间边界值问题需要额外 constitutive terms。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> this is a Gaussian-unit linear-response map. Topological media, magnetoelectric coupling, nonlinearities, and spatial boundary-value problems require additional constitutive terms.</p>
  </div>
</figure>

